        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6417.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundlich</unclear> willig dienst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuuor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ernuehste</unclear>,
<lb n="2"/>Frombe, Fuersichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersam</unclear> und weise, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Insunders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>liebe und guete <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freund</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diselben</unclear> wollen unbeschwert auß dem beyschluß
<lb n="5"/>vernemmen, warumben wir In <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichem</unclear> umb diß
<lb n="6"/>intercession schreiben ersuecht werden.
<lb n="7"/>Wann wir dann der Supplicantin not unnd
<lb n="8"/>armueth wol wißen, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> Elte=
<lb n="9"/>sten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Son</unclear> auß unserer stat <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">costen</unclear> erhalten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> gelangt an E. E. W. unser ganz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>: und
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaurlich</unclear> bitten, sy wollen diser armen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wittib</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> Iren ubrigen waisen auß christlichem mit=
<lb n="13"/>leiden umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> von Ir angedeuter ursach willen,
<lb n="14"/>auch ain ergibige hilf auß gnaden vaeterlich wider=
<lb n="15"/>fahren laßen, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seind</unclear> wir In gleichem und mehrerm
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>: nachbaurlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerwidern</unclear> und E. E. W. son=
<lb n="17"/>sten auch angeneme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtliche</unclear> dienst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerzaigen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>berait willig. Datum den <origDate when="1612-01-22" resp="#ner">22. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Januarij</unclear>. anno 1612</origDate>.
<lb n="19"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und rathe
<lb n="20"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stat</unclear> Kempten</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6418.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6419.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="21"/>Edel ernvest <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerßichtig</unclear> ersam unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weiße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ginstig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebiettendt</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>herren unnd obern. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Waß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> der allmechtig Got <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">negsthin</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jtz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehewirt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Valten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Felen</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">n</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweßnen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>burgern und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">balbierern</unclear> alhie seeligen in der loblichen
<lb n="25"/>stat <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> Gallen</placeName> durch die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erschrockliche</unclear> sucht auch hin
<lb n="26"/>weggenomen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mich</unclear> sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betriebte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witib</unclear> mit
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwangerm</unclear> leib unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">funff</unclear> kleinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unerzognen</unclear> kindern
<lb n="28"/>in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoechste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">armueths</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinderlaßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alleß</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>ist E. E. F. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. W. mer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnuegsam</unclear> bewust. Wann
<lb n="30"/>er sich dann nit auß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">muettwillen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jn</unclear> solche gefahr begeben,
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sunder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jedeweder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erjnert</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fiir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnaden</unclear> unnd
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetthaten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> wir vor etlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jaren</unclear> durch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eingelegteß</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>feur <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Felben</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßrig</unclear> komen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßelbten</unclear>, von der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">großen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">brandtstewr</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nichte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erlingen</unclear> moegen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> in berierter stat <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct
<lb n="36"/>Gallen</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">von</unclear> d oberkeit unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerschafft</unclear> alda erzaigt
<lb n="37"/>worden: so hat er sich mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> von Got <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empfangnen</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>gaben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jn</unclear> d <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorgeweßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sterbenß</unclear> not alda <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">danckh</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">barlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erzaigen</unclear> und nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> vermoegen den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jnficierten</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerbuen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">helffen</unclear> wollen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> aber sein goetlich all-
<lb n="41"/>macht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">so</unclear> bald auß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißem</unclear> leben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgfordert</unclear>,
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solcheß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obangedeuten</unclear> ursachen mir und mei-
<lb n="43"/>nen armen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waißen</unclear> am <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schmerzhafften</unclear> fallen, jch bin
<lb n="44"/>aber der troestlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoffnung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoversicht</unclear>,
<lb n="45"/>wolgedachter ein ersamer <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" resp="#ner">rath lob: stat Sanct
<lb n="46"/>Gallen</orgName> werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> mein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demuetig</unclear> anhalten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dßo</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>jch mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehistem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kuenfftigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genoetiget</unclear> bin, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diße</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>meinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betriebten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuostand</unclear> mit einer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hand</unclear>-
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raichung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ergetzlicheit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwaß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ringeren</unclear>, auff
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> jch nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißelbig</unclear> desto <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruchtbarlicher</unclear> erlangen
<lb n="51"/>moege, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuet</unclear> E. E. F. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. W. jch arme <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">witib</unclear> umb
<lb n="52"/>ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fiirbitschreiben</unclear> dahin demuetig und flehenlich
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anrueffen</unclear> und bitten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unauffhoerlich</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kindn</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">piten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrewe</unclear> Got beede E. E. F <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear> W. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">&amp;</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>bei <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gliecklicher</unclear> regierung langwierig erhalten unnd
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angehoerigen</unclear> vor allem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fernerem</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnedigst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behuetten</unclear> wolle, damit E. E.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6420.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. E. W. mich unnd meine kind zuo gnaden
<lb n="59"/>unnd guenstiger willfahrung demuetig befelchende.
<lb n="60"/>Datum <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-40" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Kempten</origPlace> den <origDate when="1612-01-22" resp="#ner">22. Januarij. A° 1612</origDate>.
<lb n="61"/>E. E. F. E. W.
<lb n="62"/>demuetige burgerin
<lb n="63"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Anna Filgueßin</persName>
<lb n="64"/>wittib.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6421.jpg" n="5"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6422.jpg" n="6"/>
<lb n="65"/>An einen ersamen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-559" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">rathe
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> deß heyligen reichs
<lb n="67"/>statt Kempten</orgName>.
<lb n="68"/>Demuetige supplication umb
<lb n="69"/>fuerbit.
<lb n="70"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Anna Eilgeßin</persName>
<lb n="71"/>witibin und bur-
<lb n="72"/>gerin daselbsten.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6423.jpg" n="7"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1744_6424.jpg" n="8"/>
<lb n="73"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrenvesten</unclear> frommen fuersichtigen ersamen
<lb n="74"/>und weisen N. N. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaistern und Raht
<lb n="75"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stat</unclear> Sanct Gallen</orgName>. unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> lieben
<lb n="76"/>und gueten freunden.
</p>
